cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this citation network or its underlying lineage data, please cite as below."
title: "The Banister Constellation: a citation network of the fitness-fatigue model lineage"
abstract: >-
  An interactive visualization of fifty years of fitness-fatigue model (FFM)
  literature, anchored on Banister 1975 and Calvert 1976. 175 papers across
  classical, variable-dose, statistical-critique, Bayesian-hierarchical, and
  PerPot branches, with a 14-paper Banister lineage chain reconstructed from
  parent_doi annotations.
